      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Anton is born and raised in the Austrian Alps. He has been painting since he is a little Boy&nbsp;  He moved to Canada in 1983 and calls Kimberley his Home \" I love those Purcell's ! \"  His Paintings in Acrylic or Oils are a Reflection of the Solitude he finds on a Mountaintop or in a"
